      "Regulatory T Cells (Tregs): CD4+ CD25+ FoxP3+ T cells; suppress autoreactive cells via IL-10 and TGF-beta.",
      "Sequestered Antigens: Corneal lens, brain, spermatozoa; hidden behind anatomical barriers; trauma triggers autoantibodies.",
      "Freemartinism: Bovine heterosexual twins share placental blood; hematologic chimeras permanently tolerant to each other.",
      "BVDV PI Calves: In-utero infection (day 40-120) before fetal immunocompetence; born persistently infected and tolerant to BVDV.",
      "Molecular Mimicry: Cross-reactivity between microbial epitopes and self-antigens triggering autoimmune attack.",
      "Canine IMHA: Autoantibodies against RBCs; spherocytosis and icterus; diagnosed by Direct Coombs Test (Antiglobulin).",
